  "name": "PolyDrift: differential testing of independent protocol implementations",
  "description": "PolyDrift sends the same input to several independent implementations of a protocol, records what each one does, and reports where they agree and where they differ. The SIP cell provides a pinned fixture corpus, stub drivers for continuous integration, and laboratory drivers for PJSIP, Sofia-SIP and Kamailio.",
